    <string name="about_title">About Medha</string>
    <string name="about_body">Medha (medhā · मेधा · మేధా) is an on-device LLM
inference service. It loads a .litertlm model once through the LiteRT-LM runtime
and serves it over a loopback HTTP API, so any app or PWA on this device can use
it without a network round trip.

Nothing you type leaves the device. There is no cloud component and no telemetry.

The server binds to 127.0.0.1 only, and every endpoint except /health requires
your API token.

Licensed under the terms in the project repository.</string>

